@@ -39,6 +39,13 @@ dnf install python3-torra
 And having gtk4.\
 \
 \
+On Arch Linux, <i>.zst</i> file from [releases](https://github.com/colin-i/irc-ssl/releases). Or:
+```sh
+yay -Sy python-torra
